<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">convīvālis</span></b>  (access. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">convīvĭā-lis</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Curt. 6, 2,
		6</span></i> Zumpt <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>N.
				cr.;</i> as var. lect. in <i><span class="en">Liv. 39, 6,
				8</span></i>, and <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 1</span></i>),
				e, adj.
			convivium, <i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to a feast, festal, convivial</i> (rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not ante-Aug.): oblectamenta ludionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					39, 6, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ludi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					5, 1, 37</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8, 4, 29</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">8, 6, 14</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sermones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carmen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Hamart. 317</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Contr. 4, 25 al.</span></i>
			—No <i>comp</i>. or <i>sup.</i></div>
